				27
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i>
			
				s.v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παλάθαι; χρυσοῦ</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>AJ</u>
				5.1.10
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				5.79
			</span></i>: esp. in Alchemy, <i>amalgam</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνέκλειπτος μ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PHolm.</u>
					2.17
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PLeid.X.</u>
				7
			</span></i>.</div>
